Native Liquid Glass navigation adaptation in NativeGlassNav.java

Effect pipeline and circle-map lens profile adapted from the user-provided
skill-liquid-glass (SdfShader.kt and the low-blur/lens/highlight guidance),
which is derived from AndroidLiquidGlass (Backdrop):
https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass
Copyright (c) Kyant0 and contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The implementation is an Android View / RuntimeShader adaptation for Xique's
existing WebView shell. It is not the upstream Compose component or a claim
of pixel-identical Apple Liquid Glass behavior. Navigation, bounded WebView
sampling, lifecycle controls and metrics were added for this application.
